content-config-digest","5982884c25df0c6e","posts",["Map"],"projects",["Map",13,14],"a-simple-screenshot-extension",{"id":13,"data":15,"body":23,"filePath":24,"assetImports":25,"digest":27,"rendered":28},{"title":16,"description":17,"pubDate":18,"heroImage":19,"tags":20,"draft":22},"A simple-screenshot-extension","A Chrome/Edge extension for taking screenshots with annotations",["Date","2026-07-10T00:00:00.000Z"],"/images/project/screen.png",[21],"Project",false,"![](menu.png)\n\n# **Screenshot Tool**\n\nA Chrome/Edge extension (MV3) for taking screenshots with annotations.\n\n## **Features**\n\n- **Full Screen** — capture the visible area of the current tab\n- **Select Area** — drag to select a region to capture\n- **Timer** — delay of 0/3/5/15 seconds before capture\n- **Editor** — annotate screenshots after capture:\n  - Tools: pencil, brush, line, rectangle, circle, arrow, text, eraser, blur\n  - Color picker and stroke width\n  - Undo / Clear\n  - Save as PNG / Copy to clipboard\n\n#### [A simple-screenshot-extension](https://github.com/OlegUshakov-pl/simple-screenshot-extension)","src/content/projects/a-simple-screenshot-extension.md",[26],"menu.png","479d0b9eaf5ac253",{"html":29,"metadata":30},"\u003Cp>\u003Cimg __ASTRO_IMAGE_=\"{&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;menu.png&quot;,&quot;index&quot;:0}\">\u003C/p>\n\u003Ch1 id=\"screenshot-tool\">\u003Cstrong>Screenshot Tool\u003C/strong>\u003C/h1>\n\u003Cp>A Chrome/Edge extension (MV3) for taking screenshots with annotations.\u003C/p>\n\u003Ch2 id=\"features\">\u003Cstrong>Features\u003C/strong>\u003C/h2>\n\u003Cul>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cstrong>Full Screen\u003C/strong> — capture the visible area of the current tab\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cstrong>Select Area\u003C/strong> — drag to select a region to capture\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cstrong>Timer\u003C/strong> — delay of 0/3/5/15 seconds before capture\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cstrong>Editor\u003C/strong> — annotate screenshots after capture:\n\u003Cul>\n\u003Cli>Tools: pencil, brush, line, rectangle, circle, arrow, text, eraser, blur\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Color picker and stroke width\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Undo / Clear\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Save as PNG / Copy to clipboard\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ul>\n\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ul>\n\u003Ch4 id=\"a-simple-screenshot-extension\">\u003Ca href=\"https://github.com/OlegUshakov-pl/simple-screenshot-extension\">A simple-screenshot-extension\u003C/a>\u003C/h4>\n",{"headings":31,"localImagePaths":42,"remoteImagePaths":43,"frontmatter":44,"imagePaths":47},[32,36,40],{"depth":33,"slug":34,"text":35},1,"screenshot-tool","Screenshot Tool",{"depth":37,"slug":38,"text":39},2,"features","Features",{"depth":41,"slug":13,"text":16},4,[26],[],{"title":16,"description":17,"pubDate":45,"heroImage":19,"tags":46,"draft":22},["Date","2026-07-10T00:00:00.000Z"],[21],[26]]